Accept three-digit compute capabilities

The capability validator tests for a fixed two-digit length, so it rejects
12.0 outright and the build stops during repository setup. Consumer Blackwell
is sm_120, and datacenter Blackwell is sm_100, which sm_120 PTX cannot reach,
so both are needed on a mixed fleet.
